<title>JAPAN: Japan's end-March beef stocks up 9.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's end-March beef stocks up 9.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's beef stocks as of end-March reached 83,630 tonnes, down by 9.5 percent from end-February but up 9.4 percent from a year earlier, the Agriculture and Livestock Industries Corporation said on Friday.</p>
<p>The breakdown of the figures is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Month	Mar 97     Feb 97	Mar 96    Mar 97/Mar 96</p>
<p> Total	83,630     92,359	80,112    +9.4 pct</p>
<p>  Domestic  10,961     11,655	11,626    +8.8 pct</p>
<p>  Imported  72,669     80,704	68,486    +9.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
